cmd-prisonadd-desc = Adds time to a player's meta-prison sentence.
cmd-prisonadd-help = Usage: prisonadd <name or user ID> <time>

cmd-prisontime-desc = Checks how much time a players' meta-prison sentence has left.
cmd-prisontime-help = Usage: prisontime <name or user ID>

cmd-prisonpardon-desc = Clears a player's meta-prison sentence.
cmd-prisonpardon-help = Usage: prisonpardon <name or user ID>
